<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-818] Permissions cannot be cleared and need appropriate defaults</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-818</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;note permissions cannot be cleared once set. This is due to a bug in the NotebookAuthorization setters for read,write,owner permissions. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Enhancement:&lt;br/&gt;
if you set readers, and writers and owners is empty set them to the user requesting the change&lt;br/&gt;
if you set writers, and owners is empty set it to the user requesting the change&lt;/p&gt;</description>
